<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>TAT Operating</title>
<meta name="description" content="TAT Operating">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

/* =====================================================================
   MEMO McKINSEY · TAT OPERATING · v6
   ===================================================================== */
:root {
    /* PALETA CLARA · papel editorial FT/HBR/WSJ */
    --bg:           #F8F4EC;   /* creme principal (paper) */
    --bg-2:         #F2EDDF;   /* creme acentuado para cards/blocos */
    --bg-3:         #EAE3D0;   /* creme escuro para hover */
    --ink:          #0A1628;   /* navy quase preto · texto principal */
    --ink-2:        #1A2E4E;   /* navy intermediário · subtitle */
    --ink-3:        #3A4A66;   /* navy mais claro · body */
    --mute:         #6B7A92;   /* cinza navy · captions */
    --mute-2:       #94A0B6;   /* cinza navy claro · metadata */
    --gold:         #8A6F3E;   /* dourado escuro sobre creme */
    --gold-2:       #6B5530;   /* dourado profundo · hover/active */
    --gold-soft:    rgba(138,111,62,0.10);
    --green:        #2D6E4A;   /* verde editorial sobre creme */
    --red:          #8B3A3A;   /* vermelho editorial sobre creme */
    --line:         rgba(10,22,40,0.10);     /* linha sutil sobre creme */
    --line-strong:  rgba(10,22,40,0.20);
    --line-gold:    rgba(138,111,62,0.40);
    /* Aliases para compatibilidade com nome antigo */
    --navy:         #F8F4EC;
    --navy-2:       #F2EDDF;
    --navy-3:       #EAE3D0;
    --cream:        #0A1628;
    --cream-2:      #1A2E4E;
    --cream-3:      #3A4A66;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

html, body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
}

::selection { background: var(--gold); color: var(--navy); }

/* =====================================================================
   RAIL SUPERIOR
   ===================================================================== */
.rail {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 92px;
    background: rgba(248,244,236,0.96);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 var(--line), 0 4px 24px rgba(10,22,40,0.04);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0 32px;
    z-index: 100;
}

.rail-brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding-right: 28px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    height: 100%;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.18s ease;
}
.rail-brand:hover { opacity: 0.72; }
.rail-brand-logo { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 5px; }
.rail-brand-name {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: 0.005em;
}

.rail-filter {
    display: flex; align-items: center;
    padding: 0 22px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    height: 100%;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
    position: relative;
}
.rail-filter:hover { background: rgba(244,238,220,0.03); }
.rail-filter.active-filter { background: var(--gold-soft); }
.rail-filter-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mute);
    margin-right: 12px;
}
.rail-filter-value {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: 0.10em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 500;
}
.rail-filter.active-filter .rail-filter-value { color: var(--gold-2); }
.rail-filter::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: 8px; top: 50%;
    width: 5px; height: 5px;
    border-right: 1.2px solid var(--mute);
    border-bottom: 1.2px solid var(--mute);
    transform: translateY(-70%) rotate(45deg);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
}
.rail-filter.open::after {
    transform: translateY(-30%) rotate(-135deg);
    border-color: var(--gold);
}

/* "+ Filtros" button */
.rail-more {
    display: none !important; /* Disabled per user request - was causing confusion */
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0 18px;
    height: 100%;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
    position: relative;
    background: transparent;
    border-top: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold-2);
}
.rail-more:hover { background: var(--gold-soft); }
.rail-more.active { background: var(--gold-soft); color: var(--gold); }
.rail-more .count {
    margin-left: 8px;
    padding: 2px 7px;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--navy);
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 600;
}
.rail-more .count.zero { display: none; }

.rail-reset {
    margin-left: auto;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--mute);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    margin-right: 18px;
}
.rail-reset:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold); }
.rail-reset.hidden { display: none; }

.rail-progress {
    display: flex; align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding-left: 22px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
    height: 100%;
    padding-right: 0;
}
.rail-progress-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--mute);
    min-width: 26px;
    text-align: right;
}
.rail-progress-dots { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
.rail-progress-dot {
    width: 28px; height: 3px;
    background: var(--line-strong);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
}
.rail-progress-dot.active { background: var(--gold); }
.rail-progress-dot:hover { background: var(--cream-3); }

/* Rail dropdown menu */
.rail-menu {
    position: absolute;
    top: 72px;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    left: 0;
    min-width: 240px;
    background: var(--navy-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.50);
    display: none;
    z-index: 200;
}
.rail-menu.open { display: block; }
.rail-menu-item {
    padding: 14px 20px;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
}
.rail-menu-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.rail-menu-item:hover { background: rgba(244,238,220,0.04); }
.rail-menu-item-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--cream);
    letter-spacing: 0.10em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}
.rail-menu-item-meta {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 9px;
    color: var(--mute);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
}
.rail-menu-item.active .rail-menu-item-label { color: var(--gold-2); }
.rail-menu-item.active::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 5px; height: 5px;
    background: var(--gold);
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-right: 10px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* =====================================================================
   PAINEL "+ FILTROS" (drawer abaixo do rail)
   ===================================================================== */
.more-panel {
    position: fixed;
    top: 72px;
    left: 0; right: 0;
    background: var(--navy-2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-gold);
    z-index: 90;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    max-height: 0;
    transition: max-height 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}
.more-panel.open {
    max-height: 280px;
    border-bottom-color: var(--line-gold);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.40);
}
.more-panel-inner {
    padding: 28px 36px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
}
.filter-group {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-left: 22px;
}
.filter-group:first-child { border-left: none; padding-left: 0; }
.filter-group-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 9.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.20em;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.filter-pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
}
.filter-pill {
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--cream-2);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.10em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.18s ease;
}
.filter-pill:hover {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    color: var(--gold);
}
.filter-pill.active {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: var(--gold-soft);
    color: var(--gold-2);
}

/* =====================================================================
   WELCOME SCREEN
   ===================================================================== */
.welcome {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 72px 0 0 0;
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 50;
    background: var(--navy);
}
body.no-cia .welcome { display: flex; }
body.no-cia .deck { display: none; }
body.no-cia .more-panel { display: none; }
body.no-cia .rail-progress { visibility: hidden; }

.welcome-inner {
    max-width: 920px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0 48px;
    text-align: center;
}
.welcome-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.32em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
}
.welcome-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 60px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.05;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.welcome-title em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--gold);
}
.welcome-sub {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--mute);
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto 56px;
}
.welcome-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
}
.welcome-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    padding: 28px 22px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    background: var(--navy);
}
.welcome-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: var(--gold-soft);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
}
.welcome-card-name {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.welcome-card-meta {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 9px;
    color: var(--mute);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.welcome-card-net-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 9px;
    color: var(--mute);
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.welcome-card-net-value {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 24px;
    color: var(--gold-2);
    font-weight: 500;
}

/* =====================================================================
   DECK · SLIDES
   ===================================================================== */
.deck {
    margin-top: 72px;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 72px);
    position: relative;
    transition: padding-top 0.35s ease;
}
body.more-open .deck { padding-top: 280px; }

.slide {
    display: none;
    padding: 60px 80px 100px;
    animation: slideIn 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}
.slide.active { display: block; }

@keyframes slideIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

.slide-inner {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
}

.slide-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-bottom: 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-bottom: 48px;
}
.slide-num {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
}
.slide-meta {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--mute);
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

.slide-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 84px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.0;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    max-width: 1100px;
}
.slide-title em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--gold);
}

.slide-lede {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--cream-2);
    margin-bottom: 56px;
    max-width: 880px;
    font-weight: 400;
}

/* Voice block (slide 1 · só Etihad) */
.voice-block {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
    padding: 14px 0 14px 22px;
    margin: -20px 0 48px 0;
    max-width: 820px;
}
.voice-text {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 19px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--cream-2);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    font-weight: 400;
}
.voice-byline {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mute);
}
.voice-name {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 600;
}
.voice-role {
    color: var(--mute);
    margin-left: 8px;
}
.voice-role::before {
    content: '·';
    margin-right: 8px;
    color: var(--line);
}

/* =====================================================================
   FOCO DE BLOCO (atenuação)
   ===================================================================== */
body[data-focus] [data-block]:not([data-block="anchor"]) {
    opacity: 0.32;
    filter: saturate(0.4);
    transition: opacity 0.35s, filter 0.35s;
}
body[data-focus="situation"] [data-block="situation-anchor"],
body[data-focus="situation"] [data-block="situation-side"],
body[data-focus="situation"] [data-block="situation-evidence"],
body[data-focus="complication"] [data-block="complication-grid"],
body[data-focus="complication"] [data-block="complication-voice"],
body[data-focus="resolution"] [data-block="resolution-anchor"],
body[data-focus="resolution"] [data-block="resolution-audit"],
body[data-focus="resolution"] [data-block="resolution-phases"],
body[data-focus="resolution"] [data-block="resolution-cta"],
body[data-focus="ebit"] [data-block="ebit"],
body[data-focus="roadmap"] [data-block="resolution-phases"],
body[data-focus="risk"] [data-block="complication-grid"] {
    opacity: 1 !important;
    filter: none !important;
}
body[data-focus] [data-block]:not([data-block="anchor"]):hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
    filter: none;
}

/* =====================================================================
   VISÃO ANALÍTICA
   ===================================================================== */
body[data-view="summary"] [data-detail-only] { display: none; }
body[data-view="technical"] [data-fin-only] { display: none; }
body[data-view="financial"] [data-tech-only] { display: none; }

/* =====================================================================
   SLIDE 1 · SITUAÇÃO
   ===================================================================== */
.situation-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
}

.anchor-number {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 168px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 0.88;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
    display: inline-block;
}
.anchor-number:hover { color: var(--gold); }
.anchor-number .ccy {
    font-size: 64px; color: var(--mute);
    font-weight: 400; margin-right: 16px;
    vertical-align: top; line-height: 1;
    position: relative; top: 22px;
}
.anchor-number .unit {
    font-size: 48px; color: var(--mute);
    font-weight: 400; margin-left: 12px;
}
.anchor-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mute);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.anchor-caption {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--mute-2);
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

.sidebar-stack {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-left: 36px;
}
.sidebar-row {
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: padding-left 0.2s ease;
}
.sidebar-row:hover { padding-left: 8px; }
.sidebar-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.sidebar-row-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mute);
}
.sidebar-row-value {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--cream);
}
.sidebar-row-value.pos { color: var(--green); }
.sidebar-row-value.warn { color: var(--red); }
.sidebar-row-value.gold { color: var(--gold-2); }

.evidence-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
    margin-top: 56px;
    padding-top: 48px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.evidence-card {
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.evidence-card:hover { border-color: var(--gold); }
.evidence-tag {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.evidence-headline {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.evidence-headline.warn { color: var(--red); }
.evidence-sub {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--mute);
    line-height: 1.55;
}

/* =====================================================================
   SLIDE 2 · COMPLICAÇÃO
   ===================================================================== */
.compl-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.compl-cell {
    padding: 36px 36px 32px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
}
.compl-cell:last-child { border-right: none; }
.compl-cell:hover { background: rgba(176,88,88,0.04); }
.compl-cell-num {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    color: var(--red);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
}
.compl-cell-name {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.compl-cell-evidence {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--cream-2);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
}
.compl-cell-data {
    padding-top: 22px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.compl-cell-data-value {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 36px;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.compl-cell-data-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 9.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--mute);
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

.voice-block {
    background: var(--navy-2);
    padding: 56px 64px 48px;
    margin-top: 32px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--gold);
    position: relative;
    cursor: pointer;
}
.voice-block::before {
    content: '"';
    position: absolute;
    top: 12px;
    left: 32px;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 100px;
    color: var(--gold);
    line-height: 1;
    opacity: 0.4;
}
.voice-text {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    padding-left: 56px;
}
.voice-author {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding-left: 56px;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
}
.voice-role {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--mute);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding-left: 56px;
}

/* =====================================================================
   SLIDE 3 · RESOLUÇÃO
   ===================================================================== */
.resolution-head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
}
.resolution-anchor-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.resolution-anchor {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 152px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--green);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    display: inline-block;
}
.resolution-anchor:hover { opacity: 0.8; }
.resolution-anchor .ccy {
    font-size: 56px; color: var(--mute);
    font-weight: 400; margin-right: 12px;
    vertical-align: top; line-height: 1;
    position: relative; top: 22px;
}
.resolution-anchor .unit {
    font-size: 44px; color: var(--mute);
    font-weight: 400; margin-left: 10px;
}
.resolution-tagline {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--cream-2);
}
.resolution-tagline em {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-style: normal;
}

.audit-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
    padding: 32px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.audit-item {
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: padding-left 0.2s ease;
}
.audit-item:hover { padding-left: 6px; }
.audit-item-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mute);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.audit-item-value {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.audit-item-value .ccy {
    font-size: 18px; color: var(--mute);
    font-weight: 400; margin-right: 4px;
}
.audit-item-sub {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--mute-2);
    letter-spacing: 0.10em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

/* EBIT mini-section (slide 3) */
.ebit-mini {
    margin: 56px 0;
    padding: 36px 40px;
    background: var(--navy-2);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--gold);
}
.ebit-mini-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.ebit-mini-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: baseline;
}
.ebit-mini-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 500;
}
.ebit-mini-title em {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-style: italic;
}
.ebit-mini-val {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 44px;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1;
}
.ebit-mini-val .small {
    font-size: 18px; color: var(--mute);
}
.ebit-mini-sub {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--mute);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 4px;
}

.phases-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
}
.phase-block {
    padding: 28px 28px 32px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
}
.phase-block:hover { border-color: var(--gold); }
.phase-num {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.phase-name {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 24px;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
}
.phase-period {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--mute);
    letter-spacing: 0.10em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding-bottom: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.phase-capture {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.phase-capture-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 9.5px;
    color: var(--mute);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

.cta-block {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 56px;
    padding-top: 48px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-top: 32px;
}
.cta-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
}
.cta-title em {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-style: italic;
}
.cta-steps {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
}
.cta-steps li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 16.5px;
    color: var(--cream-2);
}
.cta-steps li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.cta-steps .stepn {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--gold);
    min-width: 24px;
    letter-spacing: 0.10em;
}
.cta-contact {
    padding: 28px 32px;
    background: var(--navy-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    align-self: start;
}
.cta-contact-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}
.cta-contact-name {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    font-weight: 500;
}
.cta-contact-role {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 9.5px;
    color: var(--mute);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
}
.cta-contact-line {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--cream-2);
    padding: 8px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

/* =====================================================================
   NAV ARROWS + HINTS
   ===================================================================== */
.nav-arrow {
    position: fixed;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 48px; height: 48px;
    background: rgba(15,30,54,0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
    z-index: 80;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
}
.nav-arrow:hover {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: var(--gold-soft);
}
.nav-arrow.prev { left: 24px; }
.nav-arrow.next { right: 24px; }
.nav-arrow svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; stroke: var(--cream); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
.nav-arrow:hover svg { stroke: var(--gold); }
.nav-arrow.disabled { opacity: 0.25; pointer-events: none; }

.hint-footer {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 16px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 9.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--mute-2);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    z-index: 50;
    pointer-events: none;
}
.hint-footer .kbd {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin: 0 3px;
}

/* =====================================================================
   AUDIT PANEL (drawer lateral)
   ===================================================================== */
.audit-backdrop {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(10,22,40,0.65);
    backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
    z-index: 500;
    display: none;
    animation: fadeIn 0.2s ease;
}
.audit-backdrop.visible { display: block; }

@keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }

.audit-panel {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    width: 520px;
    max-width: 92vw;
    background: var(--navy-2);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line-gold);
    z-index: 600;
    transform: translateX(100%);
    transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: -24px 0 64px rgba(0,0,0,0.40);
}
.audit-panel.open { transform: translateX(0); }
.audit-panel-header {
    padding: 24px 32px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
}
.audit-panel-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.audit-panel-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 24px;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 500;
}
.audit-panel-close {
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--cream);
    width: 30px; height: 30px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    line-height: 0;
}
.audit-panel-close:hover {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    color: var(--gold);
}
.audit-panel-body {
    flex: 1;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 28px 32px;
}
.audit-value {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 48px;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    font-weight: 500;
}
.audit-section { margin-bottom: 28px; }
.audit-section-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 9.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.audit-formula {
    background: var(--navy);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--gold);
    padding: 18px 22px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--cream);
    line-height: 1.75;
    white-space: pre-line;
}
.audit-prose {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--cream-2);
}
.audit-sources {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--mute);
    line-height: 1.9;
}
.audit-sources span {
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-right: 10px;
}
.audit-sens-control {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 18px 0 22px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
}
.audit-sens-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--mute);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    min-width: 90px;
}
.audit-sens-slider {
    flex: 1;
    appearance: none;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--line-strong);
    outline: none;
    cursor: pointer;
}
.audit-sens-slider::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    appearance: none;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    width: 14px; height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold);
    cursor: pointer;
    border: 2px solid var(--navy);
}
.audit-sens-slider::-moz-range-thumb {
    width: 14px; height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold);
    cursor: pointer;
    border: 2px solid var(--navy);
}
.audit-sens-val {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--gold);
    min-width: 72px;
    text-align: right;
}
.audit-sens-result {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.audit-sens-delta {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--green);
}
.audit-sens-delta.neg { color: var(--red); }

.audit-trigger {
    cursor: pointer;
    position: relative;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
}
.audit-trigger::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -4px;
    left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--gold-2) 50%, transparent 50%);
    background-size: 6px 1px;
    opacity: 0.5;
}
.audit-trigger:hover::after { opacity: 1; }

/* =====================================================================
   RESPONSIVE
   ===================================================================== */
@media (max-width: 1400px) {
    .more-panel-inner { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 18px; }
    .anchor-number { font-size: 130px; }
    .anchor-number .ccy { font-size: 52px; top: 16px; }
    .resolution-anchor { font-size: 124px; }
    .resolution-anchor .ccy { font-size: 46px; }
    .slide-title { font-size: 68px; }
    .slide { padding: 50px 50px 80px; }
}
@media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .anchor-number { font-size: 96px; }
    .anchor-number .ccy { font-size: 40px; top: 10px; }
    .slide-title { font-size: 54px; }
    .resolution-anchor { font-size: 92px; }
    .resolution-anchor .ccy { font-size: 36px; }
    .audit-item-value { font-size: 30px; }
    .situation-grid, .resolution-head, .cta-block, .ebit-mini-row {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px;
    }
    .compl-grid, .phases-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .compl-cell { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .audit-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .welcome-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .slide { padding: 40px 28px 80px; }
    .rail { padding: 0 14px; }
    .rail-filter { padding: 0 10px; }
    .rail-filter-label { font-size: 8px; }
    .rail-filter-value { font-size: 9.5px; }
    .more-panel-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; padding: 24px 20px; }
    .more-panel.open { max-height: 480px; }
    body.more-open .deck { padding-top: 480px; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
    .slide-title { font-size: 38px; }
    .anchor-number { font-size: 72px; }
    .resolution-anchor { font-size: 68px; }
    .welcome-title { font-size: 36px; }
    .audit-panel { width: 100%; }
    .nav-arrow { width: 36px; height: 36px; }
    .audit-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .evidence-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }
    .welcome-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .more-panel-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}


/* ============= SLIDE HERO (3) - número centralizado, máximo respiro ============= */
.slide-hero .slide-inner {
    min-height: calc(100vh - 72px - 100px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 0;
}
.slide-hero .slide-header {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    border-bottom: none;
    padding-bottom: 0;
    position: absolute;
    top: 60px;
    left: 0; right: 0;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    padding: 0 80px 28px;
}
.slide-hero .slide-header::after {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--line);
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 28px;
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0; right: 0;
}
.hero-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.30em;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
}
.hero-anchor {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 220px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 0.85;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--green);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    display: inline-block;
}
.hero-anchor:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
.hero-anchor .ccy {
    font-size: 80px;
    color: var(--mute);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-right: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 1;
    position: relative;
    top: 28px;
}
.hero-anchor .unit {
    font-size: 64px;
    color: var(--mute);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-left: 14px;
}
.hero-tagline {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--cream-2);
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 36px;
    font-weight: 400;
}
.hero-tagline em {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-style: normal;
}
.hero-secondary {
    display: flex;
    gap: 56px;
    margin-top: 12px;
}
.hero-secondary-item {
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: padding-top 0.2s ease;
}
.hero-secondary-item:hover { padding-top: 4px; }
.hero-secondary-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--mute);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.hero-secondary-value {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 36px;
    color: var(--cream);
    font-weight: 500;
}
.hero-hint {
    margin-top: 40px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--mute-2);
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

/* ============= MECÂNICA (4) ============= */
.mechanic-section { margin-bottom: 80px; }
.mechanic-section:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.mechanic-section-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}

/* ============= CTA SLIDE (5) ============= */
.slide-cta .slide-inner {
    min-height: calc(100vh - 72px - 100px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
}
.cta-hero-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 84px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.0;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    max-width: 1000px;
}
.cta-hero-title em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--gold);
}
.cta-final-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-top: 32px;
}
.cta-final-steps {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
}
.cta-final-steps li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 18px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 19px;
    color: var(--cream-2);
    line-height: 1.45;
}
.cta-final-steps li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.cta-final-steps .stepn {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--gold);
    min-width: 28px;
    letter-spacing: 0.10em;
}
.cta-final-steps li strong {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}
.cta-final-steps .cta-period {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 0.10em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-left: 6px;
}
.cta-final-steps li span > span:not(.cta-period) {
    display: block;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-top: 4px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
}
.cta-base-codes {
    display: inline;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    font-weight: 500;
}

/* Responsive for hero */
@media (max-width: 1400px) {
    .hero-anchor { font-size: 180px; }
    .hero-anchor .ccy { font-size: 64px; }
    .cta-hero-title { font-size: 64px; }
}
@media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .hero-anchor { font-size: 120px; }
    .hero-anchor .ccy { font-size: 48px; top: 18px; }
    .hero-anchor .unit { font-size: 40px; }
    .hero-secondary { flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; align-items: center; }
    .cta-hero-title { font-size: 48px; }
    .cta-final-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
    .slide-hero .slide-header { padding: 0 28px 24px; top: 40px; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero-anchor { font-size: 80px; }
    .hero-anchor .ccy { font-size: 32px; top: 8px; }
    .hero-tagline { font-size: 18px; }
    .cta-hero-title { font-size: 36px; }
}



/* ============= MULTI-SELEÇÃO DE CIAS ============= */
.rail-menu-cia .rail-menu-item {
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
}
.rail-menu-cia .rail-menu-item::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 14px; height: 14px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--mute);
    margin-right: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: transparent;
    position: relative;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
}
.rail-menu-cia .rail-menu-item.active::before {
    background: var(--gold);
    border-color: var(--gold);
}
.rail-menu-cia .rail-menu-item.active::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 24px;
    top: 50%;
    width: 4px; height: 8px;
    border-right: 2px solid var(--bg);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--bg);
    transform: translateY(-65%) rotate(45deg);
}
.rail-menu-cia .rail-menu-actions {
    padding: 12px 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    background: var(--bg-2);
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: space-between;
}
.rail-menu-cia .menu-action-btn {
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
    font-weight: 500;
}
.rail-menu-cia .menu-action-btn:hover { color: var(--gold-2); }
.rail-menu-cia .menu-action-btn.muted { color: var(--mute); }
.rail-menu-cia .menu-action-btn.muted:hover { color: var(--ink); }

/* Badge consolidado */
.consolidated-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 9.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--bg);
    background: var(--gold);
    padding: 4px 11px;
    margin-left: 14px;
    vertical-align: middle;
    font-weight: 500;
    border-radius: 2px;
}

/* ============= AJUSTES DE COR PARA PALETA CLARA ============= */
::selection { background: var(--gold); color: var(--bg); }

/* Texto editorial preserva contraste */
.slide-title { color: var(--ink); }
.slide-title em { color: var(--gold); }
.slide-lede { color: var(--ink-3); }

/* Voice block light theme */
.voice-text { color: var(--ink-2); }
.voice-byline { color: var(--mute); }
.voice-name { color: var(--gold); }
.voice-role { color: var(--mute); }
.voice-role::before { color: var(--line); }

/* Anchor numbers em navy escuro (não verde mais — verde sobre creme fica fraco) */
.anchor-number { color: var(--ink); }
.anchor-number:hover { color: var(--gold); }
.anchor-number .ccy { color: var(--mute); }
.anchor-number .unit { color: var(--mute); }

.resolution-anchor { color: var(--green); }
.resolution-anchor:hover { opacity: 0.8; }
.resolution-anchor .ccy, .resolution-anchor .unit { color: var(--mute); }

/* Hero anchor em verde editorial (mais escuro pra ler sobre creme) */
.hero-anchor { color: var(--green); }
.hero-anchor .ccy, .hero-anchor .unit { color: var(--mute); }

/* Sidebar values */
.sidebar-row-value { color: var(--ink); }
.sidebar-row-value.pos { color: var(--green); }
.sidebar-row-value.warn { color: var(--red); }
.sidebar-row-value.gold { color: var(--gold); }
.sidebar-row-label { color: var(--mute); }

/* Slide-num eyebrow */
.slide-num { color: var(--gold); }
.slide-meta { color: var(--mute); }
.anchor-label, .anchor-caption { color: var(--mute); }
.resolution-anchor-label { color: var(--gold); }

/* Evidence cards sobre creme */
.evidence-card {
    border-color: var(--line-strong);
    background: var(--bg-2);
}
.evidence-card:hover { border-color: var(--gold); background: var(--bg-3); }
.evidence-tag { color: var(--gold); }
.evidence-headline { color: var(--ink); }
.evidence-headline.warn { color: var(--red); }
.evidence-sub { color: var(--ink-3); }

/* Slide 2 complication cells */
.compl-grid {
    border-color: var(--line-strong);
    background: var(--bg-2);
}
.compl-cell { border-right-color: var(--line); }
.compl-cell:hover { background: rgba(139,58,58,0.05); }
.compl-cell-num { color: var(--red); }
.compl-cell-name { color: var(--ink); }
.compl-cell-evidence { color: var(--ink-3); }
.compl-cell-data { border-top-color: var(--line); }
.compl-cell-data-value { color: var(--ink); }
.compl-cell-data-label { color: var(--mute); }

/* Voice block sobre creme */
.voice-block {
    background: var(--bg-2);
    border-left-color: var(--gold);
}
.voice-block::before { color: var(--gold); opacity: 0.5; }
.voice-text { color: var(--ink); }
.voice-author { color: var(--gold); }
.voice-role { color: var(--mute); }

/* Audit-row items */
.audit-row {
    border-top-color: var(--line);
    border-bottom-color: var(--line);
}
.audit-item-label { color: var(--mute); }
.audit-item-value { color: var(--ink); }
.audit-item-value .ccy { color: var(--mute); }
.audit-item-sub { color: var(--mute); }

/* Phases */
.phase-block {
    border-color: var(--line-strong);
    background: var(--bg);
}
.phase-block:hover { border-color: var(--gold); background: var(--bg-2); }
.phase-num { color: var(--gold); }
.phase-name { color: var(--ink); }
.phase-period { color: var(--mute); border-bottom-color: var(--line); }
.phase-capture { color: var(--ink); }
.phase-capture-label { color: var(--mute); }

/* EBIT mini section */
.ebit-mini {
    background: var(--bg-2);
    border-left-color: var(--gold);
}
.ebit-mini-label { color: var(--gold); }
.ebit-mini-title { color: var(--ink); }
.ebit-mini-title em { color: var(--gold); }
.ebit-mini-val { color: var(--ink); }
.ebit-mini-val .small { color: var(--mute); }
.ebit-mini-sub { color: var(--mute); }

/* CTA + contato */
.cta-hero-title { color: var(--ink); }
.cta-hero-title em { color: var(--gold); }
.cta-final-steps li {
    color: var(--ink-3);
    border-bottom-color: var(--line);
}
.cta-final-steps .stepn { color: var(--gold); }
.cta-contact {
    background: var(--bg-2);
    border-color: var(--line-strong);
}
.cta-contact-label { color: var(--gold); }
.cta-contact-name { color: var(--ink); }
.cta-contact-role { color: var(--mute); }
.cta-contact-line { color: var(--ink-3); border-top-color: var(--line); }

/* Hero (slide 3) */
.hero-eyebrow { color: var(--gold); }
.hero-tagline { color: var(--ink-3); }
.hero-tagline em { color: var(--gold); }
.hero-secondary-label { color: var(--mute); }
.hero-secondary-value { color: var(--ink); }
.hero-hint { color: var(--mute); }

/* Welcome screen */
.welcome { background: var(--bg); }
.welcome-eyebrow { color: var(--gold); }
.welcome-title { color: var(--ink); }
.welcome-title em { color: var(--gold); }
.welcome-sub { color: var(--ink-3); }
.welcome-card {
    border-color: var(--line-strong);
    background: var(--bg);
}
.welcome-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: var(--bg-2);
}
.welcome-card-name { color: var(--ink); }
.welcome-card-meta { color: var(--mute); border-bottom-color: var(--line); }
.welcome-card-net-label { color: var(--mute); }
.welcome-card-net-value { color: var(--gold); }

/* Rail filter selectors */
.rail-filter { border-right-color: var(--line); }
.rail-filter:hover { background: var(--bg-2); }
.rail-filter.active-filter { background: var(--gold-soft); }
.rail-filter.active-filter .rail-filter-value { color: var(--gold-2); font-weight: 600; }
.rail-filter::after { border-color: var(--mute); }
.rail-filter.open::after { border-color: var(--gold); }
.rail-brand { border-right-color: var(--line); }
.rail-progress { border-left-color: var(--line); }
.rail-progress-label { color: var(--mute); }
.rail-progress-dot { background: var(--line-strong); }
.rail-progress-dot.active { background: var(--gold); }
.rail-progress-dot:hover { background: var(--ink-3); }

.rail-more {
    border-right-color: var(--line);
    color: var(--gold);
}
.rail-more:hover { background: var(--gold-soft); }
.rail-more.active { background: var(--gold-soft); color: var(--gold-2); }
.rail-more .count { background: var(--gold); color: var(--bg); }
.rail-reset { color: var(--mute); border-color: var(--line-strong); }
.rail-reset:hover { color: var(--gold); border-color: var(--gold); }

/* Rail menu items */
.rail-menu-item:hover { background: var(--bg-2); }
.rail-menu-item-label { color: var(--ink); }
.rail-menu-item-meta { color: var(--mute); }
.rail-menu-item.active .rail-menu-item-label { color: var(--gold-2); }
.rail-menu-item.active::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 5px; height: 5px;
    background: var(--gold);
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-right: 10px;
}
/* Mas no menu de cia, override (já tem ::before customizado de checkbox) */
.rail-menu-cia .rail-menu-item.active::before {
    content: '';
    width: 14px; height: 14px;
    border-radius: 0;
    background: var(--gold);
    border-color: var(--gold);
    margin-right: 14px;
}

/* More-panel sobre creme */
.more-panel { background: var(--bg-2); border-bottom-color: var(--line-gold); }
.filter-group { border-left-color: var(--line); }
.filter-group-label { color: var(--gold); }
.filter-pill {
    border-color: var(--line-strong);
    color: var(--ink-3);
    background: transparent;
}
.filter-pill:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold); }
.filter-pill.active {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    background: var(--gold-soft);
    color: var(--gold-2);
    font-weight: 600;
}

/* Nav arrows sobre creme */
.nav-arrow {
    background: rgba(248,244,236,0.92);
    border-color: var(--line-strong);
}
.nav-arrow:hover { border-color: var(--gold); background: var(--gold-soft); }
.nav-arrow svg { stroke: var(--ink); }
.nav-arrow:hover svg { stroke: var(--gold); }

/* Hint footer */
.hint-footer { color: var(--mute); }
.hint-footer .kbd { border-color: var(--line); color: var(--gold); }

/* Audit panel sobre creme */
.audit-backdrop { background: rgba(10,22,40,0.40); }
.audit-panel { background: var(--bg); border-left-color: var(--line-gold); box-shadow: -24px 0 64px rgba(10,22,40,0.15); }
.audit-panel-header { border-bottom-color: var(--line); }
.audit-panel-eyebrow { color: var(--gold); }
.audit-panel-title { color: var(--ink); }
.audit-panel-close { color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--line); }
.audit-panel-close:hover { color: var(--gold); border-color: var(--gold); }
.audit-value { color: var(--ink); }
.audit-section-label { color: var(--gold); }
.audit-formula { background: var(--bg-2); border-left-color: var(--gold); color: var(--ink); }
.audit-prose { color: var(--ink-3); }
.audit-sources { color: var(--mute); }
.audit-sources span { color: var(--gold); }
.audit-sens-control { border-bottom-color: var(--line); }
.audit-sens-label { color: var(--mute); }
.audit-sens-slider { background: var(--line-strong); }
.audit-sens-slider::-webkit-slider-thumb { background: var(--gold); border-color: var(--bg); }
.audit-sens-slider::-moz-range-thumb { background: var(--gold); border-color: var(--bg); }
.audit-sens-val { color: var(--gold); }
.audit-sens-result { color: var(--ink); }
.audit-sens-delta { color: var(--green); }
.audit-sens-delta.neg { color: var(--red); }

/* Sidebar stack */
.sidebar-stack { border-left-color: var(--line); }
.sidebar-row { border-bottom-color: var(--line); }

/* Slide header */
.slide-header { border-bottom-color: var(--line); }
.mechanic-section-label { color: var(--gold); border-bottom-color: var(--line); }

/* Audit trigger underline (linha dourada tracejada) */
.audit-trigger::after {
    background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--gold) 50%, transparent 50%);
    opacity: 0.4;
}
.audit-trigger:hover::after { opacity: 1; }



/* SLIDE 6 SIMULADOR */
.slide-sim .slide-inner { min-height: calc(100vh - 152px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.sim-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 48px; margin-top: 32px; flex: 1; }
.sim-inputs { background: var(--bg-2); border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); padding: 32px 32px 24px; }
.sim-inputs-title {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 28px; padding-bottom: 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
}
.sim-field { margin-bottom: 24px; }
.sim-field:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.sim-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mute); margin-bottom: 8px; display: block;
}
.sim-input, .sim-select {
    width: 100%; background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    padding: 12px 16px; font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink);
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease; border-radius: 0;
    -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none;
}
.sim-input:focus, .sim-select:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--gold); }
.sim-select {
    cursor: pointer;
    background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 50%, var(--mute) 50%),
                      linear-gradient(135deg, var(--mute) 50%, transparent 50%);
    background-position: calc(100% - 18px) 50%, calc(100% - 13px) 50%;
    background-size: 5px 5px, 5px 5px; background-repeat: no-repeat; padding-right: 40px;
}
.sim-input[type=number] { -moz-appearance: textfield; }
.sim-input::-webkit-outer-spin-button, .sim-input::-webkit-inner-spin-button {
    -webkit-appearance: none; margin: 0;
}
.sim-field-meta {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 9.5px;
    color: var(--mute); margin-top: 6px; letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}
.sim-year-chips {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: 8px;
}
.sim-year-chip {
    background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    color: var(--mute); cursor: pointer;
    padding: 6px 10px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; transition: all 0.15s;
    border-radius: 2px; user-select: none; line-height: 1.4;
    display: inline-flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;
    min-width: 70px;
}
.sim-year-chip .yr { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); font-size: 12px; }
.sim-year-chip .vc { font-size: 9px; color: var(--mute); margin-top: 2px; }
.sim-year-chip:hover { border-color: var(--gold); }
.sim-year-chip.active {
    background: var(--gold); border-color: var(--gold);
    color: var(--cream);
}
.sim-year-chip.active .yr,
.sim-year-chip.active .vc { color: var(--cream); }
.sim-year-chip.partial-2026 { font-style: italic; }
.sim-year-chip.partial-2026 .yr::after {
    content: '*'; color: var(--gold); margin-left: 2px; font-size: 14px;
}
.sim-year-chip.partial-2026.active .yr::after { color: var(--cream); }
.sim-output { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
.sim-result-main {
    text-align: center; padding: 24px 0 36px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); margin-bottom: 32px;
}
.sim-result-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.sim-result-value {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 96px; font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1; color: var(--green); letter-spacing: -0.025em;
}
.sim-result-value .ccy {
    font-size: 36px; color: var(--mute); margin-right: 8px; font-weight: 400;
    vertical-align: top; position: relative; top: 12px;
}
.sim-result-value .unit {
    font-size: 28px; color: var(--mute); margin-left: 8px; font-weight: 400;
}
.sim-result-sub {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--mute); letter-spacing: 0.10em;
    margin-top: 12px; text-transform: uppercase;
}
.sim-secondary {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.sim-secondary-item {
    text-align: center; padding: 16px;
    background: var(--bg-2); border-left: 2px solid var(--gold);
}
.sim-secondary-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 9.5px;
    color: var(--mute); letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.sim-secondary-value {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1;
}
.sim-secondary-value .small {
    font-size: 14px; color: var(--mute); margin-left: 4px;
}
.sim-secondary-value.sim-net {
    color: var(--green); font-weight: 600;
}
.sim-secondary-value.sim-net .ccy {
    font-size: 18px; color: var(--green); margin-right: 4px; vertical-align: top; position: relative; top: 4px;
}
.sim-formula-box {
    padding: 18px 22px; background: var(--bg-2);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--gold);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--ink-3); line-height: 1.7; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}
.sim-formula-box strong { color: var(--gold); font-weight: 500; }
@media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .sim-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .sim-result-value { font-size: 72px; }
    .sim-result-value .ccy { font-size: 28px; top: 8px; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
    .sim-result-value { font-size: 52px; }
    .sim-result-value .ccy { font-size: 22px; top: 4px; }
    .sim-secondary { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}


.slide-sim .slide-inner { padding: 60px 80px; }
.sim-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 56px; margin-top: 32px; }
.sim-inputs { background: var(--bg-2); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; border-left: 3px solid var(--gold); }
.sim-inputs h3 { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); margin: 0 0 24px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
.sim-input-row { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.sim-input-row label { font-size: 0.72rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 600; }
.sim-input-row input, .sim-input-row select { background: var(--cream); border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); padding: 10px 14px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--ink); border-radius: 2px; transition: border-color 0.2s ease; }
.sim-input-row input:focus, .sim-input-row select:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--gold); }
.sim-input-row .helper { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--ink-3); font-style: italic; margin-top: 2px; }
.sim-outputs { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
.sim-output-card { background: var(--cream); border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 24px 28px; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; }
.sim-output-card.primary { background: var(--ink); border: none; padding: 32px 36px; }
.sim-output-card.primary .sim-out-label { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
.sim-output-card.primary .sim-out-value { color: var(--green); }
.sim-out-label { font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.15em; color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 600; }
.sim-out-value { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
.sim-output-card.primary .sim-out-value { font-size: 2.4rem; }
.sim-formula-box { grid-column: 1 / -1; background: var(--bg-2); padding: 24px 32px; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 24px; border-left: 3px solid var(--ink-3); }
.sim-formula-title { font-size: 0.72rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.sim-formula-text { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.7; white-space: pre-wrap; }
.sim-aircraft-info { background: var(--bg); padding: 12px 16px; border-left: 2px solid var(--gold); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }
.sim-aircraft-info b { color: var(--gold); font-weight: 600; }

</style>
</head>
<body class="no-cia">

<div class="rail">
    <div class="rail-brand">
        <img class="rail-brand-logo" alt="TAT" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,">
        <span class="rail-brand-name">TAT Operating</span>
    </div>

    <div class="rail-filter" data-filter="cia" id="filterCia">
        <span class="rail-filter-label" data-i18n="rail.operator">Operador</span>
        <span class="rail-filter-value" id="filterCiaValue" data-i18n-default="rail.select">Selecione</span>
        <div class="rail-menu rail-menu-cia" data-menu="cia">
            <div class="rail-menu-item" data-cia-multi="GOL">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label">GOL</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">BRL · 140 ac</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-menu-item" data-cia-multi="Azul">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label">Azul</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">BRL · 160 ac</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-menu-item" data-cia-multi="TAP">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label">TAP</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">EUR · 99 ac</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-menu-item" data-cia-multi="Etihad">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label">Etihad</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">USD · 128 ac</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-menu-item" data-cia-multi="AFKLM">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label">AF/KLM</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">EUR · 596 ac</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-menu-item" data-cia-multi="United">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label">United</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">USD · 1,065 ac</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-menu-item" data-cia-multi="Copa">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label">Copa</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">USD · 122 ac</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-menu-item" data-cia-multi="American">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label">American</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">USD · 1,026 ac</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-menu-item" data-cia-multi="Avianca">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label">Avianca</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">USD · 162 ac</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-menu-actions">
                <button class="menu-action-btn" id="ciaSelectAll" data-i18n="rail.allCias">All (9)</button>
                <button class="menu-action-btn muted" id="ciaSelectNone" data-i18n="rail.clear">Clear</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rail-filter" data-filter="horizon" id="filterHorizon">
        <span class="rail-filter-label" data-i18n="rail.horizon">Horizonte</span>
        <span class="rail-filter-value" id="filterHorizonValue">6 anos</span>
        <div class="rail-menu" data-menu="horizon">
            <div class="rail-menu-item active" data-horizon="6Y">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label" data-i18n="rail.6y">6 anos</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">2026 – 2031</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-menu-item" data-horizon="3Y">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label" data-i18n="rail.3y">3 anos</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">2026 – 2028</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-menu-item" data-horizon="1Y">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label" data-i18n="rail.1y">1 ano</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">2026 setup</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rail-filter" data-filter="scenario" id="filterScenario">
        <span class="rail-filter-label" data-i18n="rail.scenario">Cenário QAV</span>
        <span class="rail-filter-value" id="filterScenarioValue">Base</span>
        <div class="rail-menu" data-menu="scenario">
            <div class="rail-menu-item" data-scenario="bear">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label">Bear</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">QAV − 0,50</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-menu-item active" data-scenario="base">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label">Base</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta" data-i18n="rail.qavCurrent">QAV atual</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-menu-item" data-scenario="bull">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label">Bull</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">QAV + 0,75</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rail-filter" data-filter="currency" id="filterCurrency">
        <span class="rail-filter-label" data-i18n="rail.currency">Moeda</span>
        <span class="rail-filter-value" id="filterCurrencyValue">Nativa</span>
        <div class="rail-menu" data-menu="currency">
            <div class="rail-menu-item active" data-currency="native">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label" data-i18n="rail.native">Nativa</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta" data-i18n="rail.operatorCcy">moeda do operador</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-menu-item" data-currency="USD">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label">USD</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">PTAX Mai/26</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-menu-item" data-currency="BRL">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label">BRL</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">5,20 USD/BRL</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rail-menu-item" data-currency="EUR">
                <span class="rail-menu-item-label">EUR</span>
                <span class="rail-menu-item-meta">0,93 USD/EUR</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <button class="rail-more" id="moreToggle">
        <span data-i18n="rail.filters">+ Filtros</span><span class="count zero" id="moreCount">0</span>
    </button>

    <button class="rail-reset hidden" id="railReset" data-i18n="rail.reset">Reset</button>

    <div class="rail-progress">
        <span class="rail-progress-label" id="slideLabel">1 / 6</span>
        <div class="rail-progress-dots">
            <div class="rail-progress-dot active" data-goto="1" title="Situação"></div>
            <div class="rail-progress-dot" data-goto="2" title="Resolução"></div>
            <div class="rail-progress-dot" data-goto="3" title="Mecânica"></div>
            <div class="rail-progress-dot" data-goto="4" title="Próximo passo"></div>
            <div class="rail-progress-dot" data-goto="5" title="Simulador"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ============ PAINEL "+ FILTROS" ============ -->
<div class="more-panel" id="morePanel">
    <div class="more-panel-inner">
        <div class="filter-group">
            <div class="filter-group-label">Foco do slide</div>
            <div class="filter-pills" data-group="focus">
                <button class="filter-pill active" data-val="all">Tudo</button>
                <button class="filter-pill" data-val="situation">Situação</button>
                <button class="filter-pill" data-val="complication">Complicação</button>
                <button class="filter-pill" data-val="resolution">Resolução</button>
                <button class="filter-pill" data-val="ebit">EBIT</button>
                <button class="filter-pill" data-val="roadmap">Roadmap</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="filter-group">
            <div class="filter-group-label">Visão analítica</div>
            <div class="filter-pills" data-group="view">
                <button class="filter-pill active" data-val="full">Completa</button>
                <button class="filter-pill" data-val="summary">Resumo</button>
                <button class="filter-pill" data-val="technical">Técnico</button>
                <button class="filter-pill" data-val="financial">Financeiro</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="filter-group">
            <div class="filter-group-label">Tipo de aeronave</div>
            <div class="filter-pills" data-group="aircraft">
                <button class="filter-pill active" data-val="all">Toda frota</button>
                <button class="filter-pill" data-val="narrow">Narrow-body</button>
                <button class="filter-pill" data-val="wide">Wide-body</button>
                <button class="filter-pill" data-val="regional">Regional</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="filter-group">
            <div class="filter-group-label">Hub principal</div>
            <div class="filter-pills" data-group="hub" id="hubPills">
                <button class="filter-pill active" data-val="all">Todos</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="welcome">
    <div class="welcome-inner">
        <div class="welcome-eyebrow">TAT Operating · Memorando Executivo · Mai 2026</div>
        <h1 class="welcome-title">A próxima decisão é<br><em>técnica</em>, não comercial.</h1>
        <p class="welcome-sub">Selecione o operador para iniciar a análise. Cada número apresentado é auditável: clique para ver fórmula, método e fontes.</p>
        <div class="welcome-cards">
            <div class="welcome-card" data-welcome-cia="GOL">
                <div class="welcome-card-name">GOL</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-meta">BRL · 140 ac · GRU/CGH</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-label">Economia líquida 6Y</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-value">R$ 134,5 MM</div>
            </div>
            <div class="welcome-card" data-welcome-cia="Azul">
                <div class="welcome-card-name">Azul</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-meta">BRL · 160 ac · VCP/CNF</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-label">Economia líquida 6Y</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-value">R$ 72,8 MM</div>
            </div>
            <div class="welcome-card" data-welcome-cia="TAP">
                <div class="welcome-card-name">TAP</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-meta">EUR · 99 ac · LIS</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-label">Economia líquida 6Y</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-value">€ 13,2 MM</div>
            </div>
            <div class="welcome-card" data-welcome-cia="Etihad">
                <div class="welcome-card-name">Etihad</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-meta">USD · 128 ac · AUH</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-label">Net savings 6Y</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-value">US$ 26,8 MM</div>
            </div>
            <div class="welcome-card" data-welcome-cia="AFKLM">
                <div class="welcome-card-name">AF/KLM</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-meta">EUR · 596 ac · CDG+AMS</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-label">Net savings 6Y</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-value">€ 80,9 MM</div>
            </div>
            <div class="welcome-card" data-welcome-cia="United">
                <div class="welcome-card-name">United</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-meta">USD · 1.065 ac · 7 hubs</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-label">Net savings 5Y</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-value">US$ 265,4 MM</div>
            </div>
            <div class="welcome-card" data-welcome-cia="Copa">
                <div class="welcome-card-name">Copa</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-meta">USD · 122 ac · PTY</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-label">Net savings 6Y</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-value">US$ 12,7 MM</div>
            </div>
            <div class="welcome-card" data-welcome-cia="American">
                <div class="welcome-card-name">American</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-meta">USD · 1.026 ac · 10 hubs</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-label">Net savings 6Y</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-value">US$ 192,0 MM</div>
            </div>
            <div class="welcome-card" data-welcome-cia="Avianca">
                <div class="welcome-card-name">Avianca</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-meta">USD · 162 ac · BOG+SAL</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-label">Net savings 6Y</div>
                <div class="welcome-card-net-value">US$ 28,4 MM</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="deck" id="deck">

    <!-- SLIDE 1 · SITUAÇÃO -->
    <section class="slide active" data-slide="1">
        <div class="slide-inner">
            <div class="slide-header">
                <span class="slide-num" id="s1Num">01 · Situação</span>
                <span class="slide-meta" id="metaSituation">GOL · 2026</span>
            </div>

            <h2 class="slide-title" id="s1Title">Há um custo evitável<br>de combustível na sua malha.<em> Hoje.</em></h2>
            <p class="slide-lede" id="ledeSituation">QAV no maior hub doméstico saltou +100% vs Fev/2026. Aviação opera com margens estreitas. Cada litro economizado vai direto para caixa.</p>

            <div class="voice-block" id="s1VoiceBlock" style="display:none;">
                <p class="voice-text" id="s1VoiceText"></p>
                <div class="voice-byline">
                    <span class="voice-name" id="s1VoiceName"></span>
                    <span class="voice-role" id="s1VoiceRole"></span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="situation-grid">
                <div data-block="situation-anchor">
                    <div class="anchor-label" id="s1AnchorLabel">Volume de QAV economizável · 6 anos</div>
                    <div class="anchor-number audit-trigger" data-audit="volume">
                        <span id="anchorVolume">30,5</span><span class="unit">ML</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="anchor-caption" id="s1AnchorCaption">Litros não consumidos · clique para auditoria</div>
                </div>
                <div class="sidebar-stack" data-block="situation-side">
                    <div class="sidebar-row audit-trigger" data-audit="qav-hub">
                        <span class="sidebar-row-label" id="s1SideLbl1">QAV no hub</span>
                        <span class="sidebar-row-value warn" id="sideHubQav">R$ 6,40/L</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sidebar-row audit-trigger" data-audit="qav-delta">
                        <span class="sidebar-row-label" id="s1SideLbl2">Alta vs base</span>
                        <span class="sidebar-row-value warn" id="sideHubDelta">+100%</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sidebar-row audit-trigger" data-audit="frota">
                        <span class="sidebar-row-label" id="s1SideLbl3">Frota analisada</span>
                        <span class="sidebar-row-value" id="sideFrota">140 ac</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sidebar-row audit-trigger" data-audit="co2">
                        <span class="sidebar-row-label" id="s1SideLbl4">CO₂ evitável</span>
                        <span class="sidebar-row-value pos" id="sideCo2">76 kt</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="evidence-row" data-block="situation-evidence" data-tech-only>
                <div class="evidence-card audit-trigger" data-audit="qav-share">
                    <div class="evidence-tag" id="s1EvTag1">Custo Operacional</div>
                    <div class="evidence-headline">45%</div>
                    <div class="evidence-sub" id="s1EvSub1">QAV no custo operacional total (ABEAR, 2026). Qualquer redução tem impacto duplo: caixa e margem.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="evidence-card audit-trigger" data-audit="demand-peak">
                    <div class="evidence-tag" id="s1EvTag2">Demanda Estrutural</div>
                    <div class="evidence-headline warn">+40%</div>
                    <div class="evidence-sub" id="s1EvSub2">Demanda jet fuel em ago/26 vs mar/26 (IEA Birol). Pico operacional do verão setentrional. Pressão persistente.</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SLIDE 3 · RESOLUÇÃO -->
    <!-- SLIDE 3 · HERO (número-âncora puro) -->
    <section class="slide slide-hero" data-slide="2">
        <div class="slide-inner">
            <div class="slide-header">
                <span class="slide-num" data-i18n="s2.num">02 · Resolução</span>
                <span class="slide-meta" data-i18n="s2.meta">A economia capturável</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-eyebrow" data-i18n="s2.eyebrow">Economia líquida · 6 anos · pós honorários TAT</div>
            <div class="hero-anchor audit-trigger" data-audit="liq-6y">
                <span class="ccy" id="resCcy">R$</span><span id="resLiq">146,67</span><span class="unit">MM</span>
            </div>
            <p class="hero-tagline">
                <span data-i18n-html="s2.tagline">Fee fixo em jun-set/26 paga-se em <em>1-2 meses</em>.<br>
                Em 2027 operador captura <em>60%</em> · de 2028 a 2031 captura <em>80%</em>.</span>
            </p>
            <div class="hero-secondary">
                <div class="hero-secondary-item audit-trigger" data-audit="ratio">
                    <div class="hero-secondary-label" data-i18n="s2.ratio">Razão líq/honorário</div>
                    <div class="hero-secondary-value" id="ratioVal">3,0×</div>
                </div>
                <div class="hero-secondary-item audit-trigger" data-audit="net-share">
                    <div class="hero-secondary-label" data-i18n="s2.opCapture">Operador captura</div>
                    <div class="hero-secondary-value" id="netShareVal">~75%</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-hint" data-i18n="s2.hint">Clique no número para auditoria · → Mecânica</div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SLIDE 4 · MECÂNICA (audit-row + fases + EBIT) -->
    <section class="slide" data-slide="3">
        <div class="slide-inner">
            <div class="slide-header">
                <span class="slide-num" data-i18n="s3.num">03 · Mecânica</span>
                <span class="slide-meta" data-i18n="s3.meta">Os números por trás do líquido</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="slide-title" data-i18n-html="s3.title">A captura é <em>auditável</em><br>linha por linha.</h2>
            <p class="slide-lede" data-i18n="s3.lede">Bruta, honorários, razão, payback. Cada um clicável. Cada um com fórmula, premissas e fontes. Cada um defensável em board.</p>

            <div class="mechanic-section">
                <div class="mechanic-section-label" data-i18n="s3.decomp">Decomposição financeira</div>
                <div class="audit-row" style="margin: 0; padding: 0; border: none;">
                    <div class="audit-item audit-trigger" data-audit="bruta-6y">
                        <div class="audit-item-label" data-i18n="s3.gross">Economia bruta 6Y</div>
                        <div class="audit-item-value"><span class="ccy" id="brutaCcy">R$</span><span id="brutaVal">180,14</span> MM</div>
                        <div class="audit-item-sub" data-i18n="s3.grossSub">redução direta de QAV</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="audit-item audit-trigger" data-audit="tat-6y">
                        <div class="audit-item-label" data-i18n="s3.fees">Honorários TAT</div>
                        <div class="audit-item-value"><span class="ccy" id="tatCcy">R$</span><span id="tatVal">34,68</span> MM</div>
                        <div class="audit-item-sub" data-i18n="s3.feesSub">fee fixo + success</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="audit-item audit-trigger" data-audit="ratio">
                        <div class="audit-item-label" data-i18n="s3.ratio">Razão líq/honorário</div>
                        <div class="audit-item-value" id="ratioVal2">3,0×</div>
                        <div class="audit-item-sub" data-i18n="s3.ratioSub">$1 pago retorna $3</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="audit-item audit-trigger" data-audit="net-share">
                        <div class="audit-item-label" data-i18n="s3.opCap">Operador captura</div>
                        <div class="audit-item-value" id="netShareVal2">~75<span style="font-size:18px;color:var(--mute);font-weight:400;">%</span></div>
                        <div class="audit-item-sub" data-i18n="s3.opCapSub">líquido sobre o bruto</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mechanic-section">
                <div class="mechanic-section-label" data-i18n="s3.phases">Execução em três fases</div>
                <div class="phases-row" data-block="resolution-phases" style="margin: 0;">
                    <div class="phase-block audit-trigger" data-audit="phase-1">
                        <div class="phase-num" data-i18n="s3.phase1">Fase 01 · Setup</div>
                        <div class="phase-name" data-i18n="s3.netCapture">Captura líquida</div>
                        <div class="phase-period" data-i18n="s3.junset26">Jun – Set 2026</div>
                        <div class="phase-capture"><span id="phase1Cap">R$ 8,05 MM</span></div>
                        <div class="phase-capture-label" id="phase1Label">fee fixo se paga em ~1 mês</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="phase-block audit-trigger" data-audit="phase-2">
                        <div class="phase-num" data-i18n="s3.phase2">Fase 02 · Pico</div>
                        <div class="phase-name" data-i18n="s3.opCap">Operador captura</div>
                        <div class="phase-period" data-i18n="s3.jandez27">Jan – Dez 2027</div>
                        <div class="phase-capture"><span id="phase2Cap">60%</span></div>
                        <div class="phase-capture-label" data-i18n="s3.netP2">líquido (40% TAT = rec + success)</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="phase-block audit-trigger" data-audit="phase-3">
                        <div class="phase-num" data-i18n="s3.phase3">Fase 03 · Esteira</div>
                        <div class="phase-name" data-i18n="s3.opCap">Operador captura</div>
                        <div class="phase-period">2028 – 2031</div>
                        <div class="phase-capture"><span id="phase3Cap">80%</span></div>
                        <div class="phase-capture-label" data-i18n="s3.netP3">líquido (recorrente 20%)</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SLIDE 5 · CTA + Contato -->
    <section class="slide slide-cta" data-slide="4">
        <div class="slide-inner">
            <div class="slide-header">
                <span class="slide-num" data-i18n="s4.num">04 · Próximo passo</span>
                <span class="slide-meta" data-i18n="s4.meta">Diagnóstico · implantação · calibração · operação plena</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="cta-hero-title">Como vamos <em>operar</em><br>do diagnóstico à esteira.</h2>
            <div class="cta-final-grid">
                <div>
                    <ol class="cta-final-steps">
                        <li><span class="stepn">01</span><span><strong id="ctaStep1Title">Diagnóstico</strong> <span class="cta-period" id="ctaStep1Period">· jun-jul/26</span><br><span id="ctaStep1Body">—</span></span></li>
                        <li><span class="stepn">02</span><span><strong id="ctaStep2Title">Implantação</strong> <span class="cta-period" id="ctaStep2Period">· ago-set/26</span><br><span id="ctaStep2Body">—</span></span></li>
                        <li><span class="stepn">03</span><span><strong id="ctaStep3Title">Calibração</strong> <span class="cta-period" id="ctaStep3Period">· out-dez/26</span><br><span id="ctaStep3Body">—</span></span></li>
                        <li><span class="stepn">04</span><span><strong id="ctaStep4Title">Operação plena</strong> <span class="cta-period" id="ctaStep4Period">· a partir de jan/27</span><br><span id="ctaStep4Body">—</span></span></li>
                    </ol>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SLIDE 6 · SIMULADOR -->
    <section class="slide slide-sim" data-slide="5">
        <div class="slide-inner">
            <div class="slide-header">
                <span class="slide-num" data-i18n="s5.num">05 · Simulador</span>
                <span class="slide-meta" data-i18n="s5.meta">Calibre os parâmetros · veja o impacto</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="slide-title" data-i18n-html="s5.title">Simule cenários. <em>Por aeronave</em>, por período.</h2>
            <p class="slide-lede" data-i18n-html="s5.lede">Escolha um modelo e calcule a economia anual em tempo real. <strong>7 parâmetros editáveis</strong> · todos com default vindo do estudo da cia ativa: QAV baseline · frota 2027 · tanque ATA 38 · block time · voos/mês média · load factor real.</p>
            <div class="sim-grid">
                <div class="sim-inputs">
                    <div class="sim-inputs-title" data-i18n="s5.paramsTitle">Parâmetros · Edite à vontade</div>
                    <div class="sim-field">
                        <label class="sim-label" data-i18n="s5.lblAc">Modelo de aeronave</label>
                        <select class="sim-select" id="simAircraft"></select>
                        <div class="sim-field-meta" id="simAircraftMeta">—</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sim-field">
                        <label class="sim-label" data-i18n="s5.lblQav">QAV · preço local</label>
                        <input type="number" class="sim-input" id="simQav" step="0.10" min="0" value="6.40">
                        <div class="sim-field-meta" id="simQavMeta">moeda local da cia · por litro</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sim-field">
                        <label class="sim-label" data-i18n="s5.lblFleet">Frota · quantidade de aeronaves</label>
                        <input type="number" class="sim-input" id="simFleet" step="1" min="1" value="50">
                        <div class="sim-field-meta">unidades em operação</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sim-field">
                        <label class="sim-label" data-i18n="s5.lblBlock">Faixa horária · Block Time</label>
                        <select class="sim-select" id="simBlock"></select>
                        <div class="sim-field-meta" id="simBlockMeta">faixas dos estudos finais · cada cia tem sua segmentação</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sim-field">
                        <label class="sim-label" data-i18n="s5.lblFlights">Voos por aeronave · por mês</label>
                        <input type="number" class="sim-input" id="simFlights" step="1" min="1" value="120">
                        <div class="sim-field-meta" id="simFlightsMeta">média da cia: voos/ano ÷ frota ÷ 12</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sim-field">
                        <label class="sim-label" data-i18n="s5.lblTank">Capacidade do tanque · litros</label>
                        <input type="number" class="sim-input" id="simTank" step="1" min="10" value="200">
                        <div class="sim-field-meta" id="simTankMeta">default: ATA 38 da aeronave selecionada</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sim-field">
                        <label class="sim-label" data-i18n="s5.lblLF">Load factor · % ocupação</label>
                        <input type="number" class="sim-input" id="simLF" step="0.1" min="50" max="100" value="80">
                        <div class="sim-field-meta" id="simLFMeta">default: load factor 2027 da cia (estudo)</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sim-field sim-years-field">
                        <label class="sim-label" data-i18n="s5.lblYears">Anos do programa · selecione um ou vários</label>
                        <div class="sim-year-chips" id="simYearChips"></div>
                        <div class="sim-field-meta" id="simYearsMeta">voos/ano · dados dos estudos finais</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="sim-output">
                    <div>
                        <div class="sim-result-main">
                            <div class="sim-result-label" id="simResultLabel">Economia BRUTA · 12 meses</div>
                            <div class="sim-result-value">
                                <span class="ccy" id="simCcy">R$</span><span id="simResult">0,00</span><span class="unit">MM</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="sim-result-sub" id="simResultSub">por mês: — · por voo: —</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="sim-secondary">
                            <div class="sim-secondary-item">
                                <div class="sim-secondary-label" data-i18n="s5.netCia">Líquido cia · pós TAT 20%</div>
                                <div class="sim-secondary-value sim-net"><span class="ccy" id="simNetCcy">R$</span><span id="simNet">—</span><span class="small" data-i18n="s5.mmano">MM/ano</span></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="sim-secondary-item">
                                <div class="sim-secondary-label" data-i18n="s5.waterExc">Água excedente</div>
                                <div class="sim-secondary-value"><span id="simWater">—</span><span class="small" data-i18n="s5.lvoo">L/voo</span></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="sim-secondary-item">
                                <div class="sim-secondary-label" data-i18n="s5.qavAvoid">QAV evitado</div>
                                <div class="sim-secondary-value"><span id="simFuel">—</span><span class="small" data-i18n="s5.lvoo">L/voo</span></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sim-formula-box" data-i18n-html="s5.formulaBox">
                        <strong>Fórmula:</strong> Economia = min(Evit_estudo, Tanque−Consumo) × k_h × Block × QAV × Voos_anos_selecionados × LF<br>
                        <strong>Voos por ano:</strong> dados oficiais dos estudos finais (curva de crescimento por cia)<br>
                        <strong>Load Factor:</strong> GOL 82% · Azul 80% · TAP 83% · Etihad 88,5% (estudos finais)<br>
                        <strong>Tudo editável:</strong> mude qualquer parâmetro e o resultado recalcula em tempo real
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>


</div>

