entation (Oct-Dec/26)", "liq_2026": 0.0, "liq_2027_pct": 55, "liq_steady_pct": 75, "payback_months": 0.3, "qav_baseline": 1.00, "delta_per_005": 13.68, "co2": 874, "volume_6y": 349.6, "qav_hub_default": "DFW", "qav_value_default": "US$ 1,00/L", "qav_delta_default": "+59% vs Q1 2025", "qav_source_default": "EIA STEO May/26 + AA 8-K Q1 2026", "hubs": ["DFW", "CLT", "ORD", "MIA", "JFK", "LGA", "LAX", "PHL", "PHX", "DCA"], "ebit_margin_base": 0.06, "revenue_usd_bb": 55.0, "language": "en", "voice_text": "Our performance demonstrates the strength of our premium offerings and our strategic network expansions. Despite external challenges, we are committed to delivering value through disciplined cost management and innovative growth initiatives.", "voice_name": "Robert Isom", "voice_role": "CEO · American Airlines", "voos_ano_2027": 2100000, "voos_mes_medio_aeronave": 171, "load_factor": 0.84, "load_factor_label": "84.0%", "study_version": "v2 · May/26 · 10 hubs · SBTi-validated", "tagline_window_label": "Jul/27-Jun/28 success fee window", "tagline_steady_label": "from Jul/28 to 2031"}, "Avianca": {"currency": "USD", "symbol": "US$", "fleet": 162, "bruta_6y": 37.96, "tat_6y": 9.58, "liq_6y": 28.38, "bruta_ann": 7.78, "fee_fixo": 0.425, "fee_fixo_breakdown": "US$ 150k diagnostic (Aug/26) + US$ 275k implementation (Sep-Oct/26)", "liq_2026": 0.86, "liq_2027_pct": 60, "liq_steady_pct": 80, "payback_months": 0.8, "qav_baseline": 1.00, "delta_per_005": 1.90, "co2": 106, "volume_6y": 42.47, "qav_hub_default": "BOG", "qav_value_default": "US$ 1,00/L", "qav_delta_default": "+59% vs FY2024", "qav_source_default": "EIA STEO May/26 · Cartagena CHB spot", "hubs": ["BOG", "SAL", "MDE", "CLO", "CTG"], "ebit_margin_base": 0.08, "revenue_usd_bb": 5.2, "language": "en", "voice_text": "We have transformed Avianca's business model to be a more efficient, sustainable and competitive company — operational efficiency is at the core of everything we do.", "voice_name": "Adrian Neuhauser", "voice_r